Package: zuxmltest
Title: Downstream Consumer Fixture for zuxml
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Not for release. Consumes zuxml exactly as zuxlsx does, through
    LinkingTo alone: the Expat headers come off the LinkingTo include path and
    the installed lib/libzuxml.a is linked statically by ./configure, so there is no
    Imports entry and no run-time dependency on zuxml. It exists so that a
    broken archive, a missing header or a configure that cannot find either is
    discovered here rather than downstream.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LinkingTo: zuxml
